- Webshop
- CRM
- PIM
- Marketing tools
- Order history
- Product browsing behaviour

Common use cases:

- Abandoned cart
- Product recommendations
- Category interest personalisation
- Repeat purchase campaigns
- Cross-sell and upsell
- Paid media retargeting

Design emphasis:

